# 📱 SMS Spam Prediction using SVM

A Machine Learning web application that classifies SMS messages as **SPAM** or **NOT SPAM** using **TF-IDF Vectorization** and a **Linear Support Vector Machine (SVM)**.

## 🚀 Live Demo

🌐 **[Open SMS Spam Detector](https://smsspamprediction.vercel.app/)**

💻 **[GitHub Repository](https://github.com/mehfooz084/sms_spam_prediction)**

## 🧠 Algorithm

- **TF-IDF (Term Frequency-Inverse Document Frequency)** — text feature extraction
- **Linear Support Vector Machine (LinearSVC)** — SMS classification

## 📊 Model Performance

Evaluated on **1,034 test SMS messages**.

| Metric | Score |
|---|---:|
| Accuracy | **98%** |
| Macro F1 Score | **0.95** |
| Weighted F1 Score | **0.98** |

### Class-wise Performance

| Class | Precision | Recall | F1-Score |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| HAM / NOT SPAM | 0.98 | 1.00 | 0.99 |
| SPAM | 0.97 | 0.87 | 0.92 |

